The '''Senate Garage'''<ref name="WTTR-Script">{{Disney|subdomain=assets.debut|url=documents/Andor%20209%20--%20POST%20FINAL%20--%203.3.24%5B1%5D.pdf|text=Episode #209 "Welcome To The Rebellion" Script|format=PDF}} {{C|page 15}}</ref> was multiple parking structures for the [[Imperial Senate Building]] where [[senator]]s could park their [[speeder]]s.<ref name="Welcome" />

In [[2 BBY]],<ref name="Date">{{AndorDate|209}}</ref> Senator [[Mon Mothma]]'s driver and [[Imperial Security Bureau]] plant [[Exmar Kloris]] used the garage to park Mothma's [[JPP-192 limospeeder]].<ref name="Welcome" />

==Behind the scenes==
The Senate Garage appeared in "[[Welcome to the Rebellion]]," the ninth episode of the [[Andor Season 2|second season]] of the television series ''[[Star Wars: Andor]]'' released on [[Disney+]]<ref name="Welcome" /> on [[May 6]], [[2025]].<ref name="Trailer News">{{SW|url=news/andor-season-2-teaser-trailer-key-art-reveal|text=First ''Andor A Star Wars Story'' Teaser Trailer and Poster Revealed}}</ref> It was first identified by name within the script for the episode written by [[Dan Gilroy]], and published on [[Disney Debut]].<ref name="WTTR-Script" /> ''[[REBELIÓN: An Andor Zine]]'', published physically and released digitally via Disney Debut featured an excerpt (page 29) of the same script, with the name.<ref name="AndorZine">[[REBELIÓN: An Andor Zine]]</ref>

